  "id": "axenfeldrieger-syndrome",
  "term": "Axenfeld–Rieger syndrome",
  "definition": "Axenfeld–Rieger syndrome is an inherited developmental disorder linked in this packet to PITX2 mutations. It involves abnormal development of the front part of the eye along with underdeveloped teeth, distinctive craniofacial differences, and umbilical abnormalities.",
